                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0fb7ad2d-5de8-33d3-86cd-3c0e59e69ea0",
                                        "entry_id": "6d21343f-9253-3e2e-9fa6-21f66287f3bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dislikable person, a disagreeable person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "sometimes",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1da30be2-358d-466c-b9ac-42e997983bfd",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb7ad2d-5de8-33d3-86cd-3c0e59e69ea0",
                                                "text": "Since we seem to be gittin' into some slightly more narsty pet names... My sister called her ex-husband \"Butt Face\" (maybe that's why he's an \"ex\" now.)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d1b807c-6884-4299-a18e-0c126ec60af2",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb7ad2d-5de8-33d3-86cd-3c0e59e69ea0",
                                                "text": "\"You've made your point, buttface,\" Allen snarled. \"Now let me make mine.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f368ad9d-7ea1-4fda-abe2-c46bb52fe354",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb7ad2d-5de8-33d3-86cd-3c0e59e69ea0",
                                                "text": "\"Okay, he's a buttface,\" says Darryl, pleased with his cleverness. \"That's it!\" shouts his mom. \"You're in your room for the rest of the day.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fa5f6b2-1bb5-40ab-9635-b830e95cba0c",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb7ad2d-5de8-33d3-86cd-3c0e59e69ea0",
                                                "text": "\"You're not making this easy, Kyle! My name's Peter Griffin, I'm a big, fat, dumb buttface!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efabf24d-7d14-4d56-9073-da23d543ec7c",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb7ad2d-5de8-33d3-86cd-3c0e59e69ea0",
                                                "text": "\"Who's Jamal?\" \"My friend. Don't you have any friends yet, buttface?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c9495963-d1aa-44c4-ae42-64c3db284824",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6094ac5-52b4-3a6a-8b42-516a28977fca",
